></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:8.75%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;border-top:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_yex944g7NUmURe-rJzFzUg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AccountsReceivableNetCurrent" scale="3" id="Tc_MJVEqkm8uUO0g-Jl0M2IiA_5_3">455,829</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:2.05%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:1.37%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;border-top:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;margin:0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:8.72%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;border-top:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_zYC0o5wkBEO2b3h9YCm4kg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AccountsReceivableNetCurrent" scale="3" id="Tc_ZmSRVvclZUGxN_Girna6Mw_5_6">452,573</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:0.88%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">At the end of each quarter, an allowance for credit losses has been calculated based on the current quarterly revenue multiplied by the historical loss percentage of the prior three-year period and recorded in the income statement. In addition to the evaluation of historical losses, the Company considers current and future economic conditions and events such as changes in customer credit quality and liquidity. The Company will write-off accounts receivable against this allowance when the Company determines a balance is uncollectible.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-21</p></div></div>
