th:8.45%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_yex944g7NUmURe-rJzFzUg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentAndFinanceLeaseRightOfUseAssetAfterAccumulatedDepreciationAndAmortization" scale="3" id="Tc_33L1ikDCp0mv1NJ-xNemUA_11_3">111,778</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.24%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.61%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;margin:0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:8.44%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_zYC0o5wkBEO2b3h9YCm4kg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentAndFinanceLeaseRightOfUseAssetAfterAccumulatedDepreciationAndAmortization" scale="3" id="Tc_G5uWuTJLRU6SXBrC3KK2xQ_11_6">132,051</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.1%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">Depreciation and amortization expense for property, plant and equipment was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_zyD8AS5Wbki7ljkdRW2qOA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="6" id="Narr_4tzPPaVRXEaJjq8scgS6jQ">53.9</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_A0aYRnROCE2Byog14o4Igw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="6" id="Narr_aqJhIwn-y0abBY46XQwMKw">61.2</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_h8ncht8wBE62JCkZFZ7E8Q" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="6" id="Narr_NhT61p95NUeYOI2gPIz0lQ">64.2</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million for the years ended December&#160;31, 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">Included in the computer equipment and software is internally developed software of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis_us-gaap_SoftwareDevelopmentMember_iOZLHRI3ckyWgDZEFQ88-w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentAndFinanceLeaseRightOfUseAssetAfterAccumulatedDepreciationAndAmortization" scale="6" id="Narr_yMKG2WOHO0-A6YtiKop3Wg">55.9</ix:nonFraction> million net and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_us-gaap_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis_us-gaap_SoftwareDevelopmentMember_7tvuw-Y3F0qto3J68xlpXA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentAndFinanceLeaseRightOfUseAssetAfterAccumulatedDepreciationAndAmortization" scale="6" id="Narr_rYDeQPbyWk-CMaOPSt9XPw">54.4</ix:nonFraction> million net as of December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. During 2025, 2024 and 2023, impairments of internally developed software of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis_us-gaap_SoftwareDevelopmentMember_sJlcThTMkkOhxEtAnhPTkQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetImpairmentCharges" scale="6" id="Narr_ZZXeL2buKEOZj8hah26BwA">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis_us-gaap_SoftwareDevelopmentMember_Q6eItdest0ivaqJreeFT4w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetImpairmentCharges" scale="6" id="Narr_IPBueVIF4kO3MIs0edO97A">3.7</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_us-gaap_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis_us-gaap_SoftwareDevelopmentMember_0y7ob9qf4kyMJ3DxrnOZWQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetImpairmentCharges" scale="6" id="Narr_69r67fK_PEmboR0mkb5kPg">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively, were expensed and included in Impairment losses in the Consolidated Statements of Comprehensive Income (Loss).</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On November 5, 2024, TTEC Holdings, Inc., through its wholly-owned subsidiary, TTEC Services Corporation, entered into a definitive agreement to sell and subsequently closed the sale of a real estate asset in Englewood, Colorado for $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="Duration_11_5_2024_To_11_5_2024_us-gaap_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis_ttec_FormerHeadquartersBuildingMember_-fc7MYqf8ECb8IZ0Lsr1Hw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfBuildings" scale="6" id="Narr_uVBIdEMqxE-i7njdOPwsvA">45.5</ix:nonFraction> million, subject to certain customary adjustments. The Company recorded a pre-tax gain of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="Duration_10_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis_ttec_FormerHeadquartersBuildingMember_Bhil5UK9d0iEJ2ds-Eyc1A" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:GainLossOnSaleOfProperties" scale="6" id="Narr_rxdY-hfAUUeZ4KJoBXOesQ">15.5</ix:nonFraction> million upon close of the transaction in the fourth quarter of 2024 in other income (expense), net within the Consolidated Statements of Comprehensive Income (Loss). The Company utilized the proceeds from the sale to reduce its outstanding balance under its revolving line of credit.</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:7pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:5pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="_Hlk508624313"></a><a id="_21b60844_28ad_4486_b27c_bd65f19a9938"></a><a id="Tc__ixo7YgcAUmwcMDqlm-DKw_1_11"></a><a id="Tc_XGiqCHkEyUGRxKB2nFRINw_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_k29F0AC1G0Wy4OIAfxdVeQ_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_w3YWhCHnZ06y3_Vln1hvEQ_2_11"></a><a id="Tc_9fTV35_BeEKIEEr3HD1A2w_2_14"></a><a id="Tc_g7pPQ1vvEkyzEUrS05-JNg_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_nGDXe_7VfEWf1tvf5C5y0Q_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_grRUqr81tk-xflm3A9pr8Q_3_8"></a><a id="Tc_4hC