gin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:1.97%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:9.08%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;"> (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_zyD8AS5Wbki7ljkdRW2qOA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerLiabilityRevenueRecognized" sign="-" scale="3" id="Tc_X-LMUtwDHUSv1HyYwEyTug_3_3">281,979</ix:nonFraction>)</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:1.44%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:84.8%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;margin:0pt;">Balance as of December&#160;31, 2025</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:2.69%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:1.97%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;margin:0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:9.08%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_yex944g7NUmURe-rJzFzUg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerLiability" scale="3" id="Tc_9WX8MmPSjU6MnfWof37B2A_4_3">61,968</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:1.44%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">Revenue recognized for the year ended December&#160;31, 2025 from amounts included in deferred revenue as of December 31, 2024 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_zyD8AS5Wbki7ljkdRW2qOA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ttec:ContractWithCustomerRevenueRecognized" scale="6" id="Narr_sTyF5T4Yc0q7rE4iMZtuuA">64.8</ix:nonFraction> million. Revenue recognized for the year ended December 31, 2024 from amounts included in deferred revenue as of December 31, 2023 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_A0aYRnROCE2Byog14o4Igw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ttec:ContractWithCustomerRevenueRecognized" scale="6" id="Narr_q2AIm6_cq0ylSgVUCn4bfQ">81.2</ix:nonFraction> million.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">Remaining performance obligations (&#8220;RPO&#8221;) represent the amount of contracted future revenue that has not yet been recognized, including both deferred revenue and non-cancelable contracted amounts that will be invoiced and recognized as revenue in future periods. The Company&#8217;s RPO excludes performance obligations from on-demand arrangements as there are no minimum purchase commitments associated with these arrangements, and certain time and materials contracts that are billed in arrears.</p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">As of December&#160;31, 2025, the Company&#8217;s RPO was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Dze-CAjoCUOfvtJoEMTwxg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionStartDateAxis_2026-01-01_fqkbJGAzakynKCGL_m_csA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligation" scale="6" id="Narr_tiZNgwjiQEOzv-hGSPRyXw">358.6</ix:nonFraction> million, which will primarily be delivered and recognized within the next <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_GMxwobYEQ06WKWmv4BofIw;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">five year</span></span>s. The Company expects to recognize approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_pIFYEG--0kK_DOWwcZuHVg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionStartDateAxis_2026-01-01_fqkbJGAzakynKCGL_m_csA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_3PFmJLvmNEWGlYKK1wn98Q">59</ix:nonFraction>% of the RPO over the next <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionStartDateAxis_2026-01-02_GK6L4_DgxUiSJjOyasWFSg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionPeriod1" id="Narr_ygUFKTTpYUqDCOjTTDZdfA">12 months</ix:nonNumeric>, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_pIFYEG--0kK_DOWwcZuHVg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationExpectedTimingOfSatisfactionStartDateAxis_2027-01-01_yBkzGgU3-0ewGU7d3BqDnQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_lwvSh-nv2EWWEtYQV7H0Mw">25</ix:nonFraction>% of the RPO over the subsequent <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_rEmy4mNC-0qwGvj2Rw2WyQ;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">13</span></span> to 24 months, and the <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_28mMlMlbz0SCA8phii-f8A;"><span style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">remainder</span></span> thereafter. </p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:5pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:5pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-38</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.41%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.29% 30pt 10.29%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.29%;padding-right:10.29%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;"><a href="#Toc"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">TTEC HOLDINGS, INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</b></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes to the Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="_Hlk508624301"></a><a id="_798a9e0c_f0c3_4789_9bd3_c4d2503d517c"></a><a id="Tc_HfChZNnibkuuIfuxr1ijIA_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_rivsVJnUDEm6D04CoMvxBA_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_i2-vXedZw06hD3ALbbw49Q_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_IgPUWfOnZkabXrnMOQ6Z4g_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_9xYQvcOTWUKQkvh4TyDqCA_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_m-dqY6WslEOSgV4Ro_JxcQ_2_7"></a><a id="Tc_CgBTrfuH502bBucd8MNCLQ_2_10"></a><a id="Tc_A8YtFFD-jk2OZS6bKDbJ0w_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_-f5J7FgCgUmSSrn0XSuc5g_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_Ph6hqJm7cUqWrdPCq4RKcQ_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_0mDy47iZZ0CUvaoNiZhJfg_3_7"></a><a id="Tc_rpAHf8NGUkWiDyRzLtdJmA_3_10"></a><a id="Tc_V7lATvcZvk22Df1VNNgP5g_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_gGCTBElsiEW1S2oKR-oxzA_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_K2E5ObycqUGj2rE0Pnwy6A_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_B9LPYzUhAkS3Qv78XELqsw_5_2"></a><a id="Tc_X1j6SnZlHUKRCt8p0oWWtw_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_UWnadKOle0-Qcc0vgm-vNw_6_2"></a><a id="Tc_YGviovWVokO6vT7WMa3FfA_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_PwAtJhrfl0qI1o2LN3ONZQ_7_2"></a><a id="Tc_ZbYNNNZ_6UydgAlz_gEYcA_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_GT8UGGDs00ed33AAVA--wg_8_2"></a><a id="Tc_BWk9U8JMSEuLx-3pxfd_GA_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_qWOaTii5zUaDgTULWrokMw_9_